                                "sense_id": "2f5517ec-7dc8-3575-a98a-a65fbba4c5da",
                                "text": "Short and thick set, he almost invariably dressed in a Western business suit or a safari jacket once he gave up his military uniform, and a black songkok, the flat traditional Indonesian cap."
